    """
    
    The loss :math:`\\rho(r)` for a given residual ``r`` is:
    
    .. math::
      \\begin{equation}
        \\rho(r)=
        \\begin{cases}
          \\frac{r^{2}}{2}, & |r| \\leq k.\\\\
